<![CDATA[<br><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><strong>An Opportunity Request for Premier Support&nbsp;has been submitted to your Organization and requires Approval or Rejection by a&nbsp;Support Org Admin.</strong></span></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><div align="center"><font color="#666666"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">_______________________________________________________________</b></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><div align="center"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><strong>Opportunity Premier Support Request Details</strong></span></div><br></div><div style=""><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Opportunity Request:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Name}</span></font></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Opportunity Name:</strong>&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Opportunity__c}</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Approval Status:</strong>&nbsp;</span><font color="#ff0000" face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Core_IPS_Approval_Status__c}</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Account:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Core_IPS_Account_Name__c}</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Region:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Core_IPS_Account_Region__c}</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Sub Region:&nbsp;</strong></span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Core_IPS_Account_Sub_Region__c}</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Supported Product(s): </strong></span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Core_IPS_Supported_ProductsName__c}</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Requester:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.CreatedBy}</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;"><strong>Justification:</strong>&nbsp;</span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Core_IPS_Request_Justification__c}</span></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><strong>To Approve or Reject this Opportunity Premier Support Request please:</strong><strong>&nbsp;<a href="{!Core_IPS_Opportunity_PAR__c.Link}">Click Here</a></strong></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt">NOTE:&nbsp; Approval to this request will create a Premier Support Project in DRAFT mode.</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font><font color="#666666"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">_______________________________________________________________</b></font><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1" face="arial" color="#666666"><b><br></b></font></span></p><p><span style="font-size:7.5pt"><span style="color:#666666"><strong>This message contains Intel Confidential information and should be handled in accordance with your Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) with Intel. Access to this e-mail by anyone other than the intended recipient is unauthorized. If you are not the intended recipient (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not use, copy, distribute, or deliver this message or any part of its contents or take any action in reliance on it, and in such case, you should destroy this message.</strong></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:7.5pt"><span style="color:#666666"><strong>Copyright ©Intel Corporation. All rights reserved. Intel Corporation, 2200 Mission College Blvd., M/S RNB4-145, Santa Clara, CA 95054-1549 USA </strong><a data-cke-saved-href="http://www.intel.com" href="http://www.intel.